    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>IF YOU LIKE THE GAME, PLEASE WISHLIST</strong> \ud83d\udd25<br>You'll get notified when we launch the demo and it helps us reach more players! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drakontias</strong> is an illustrated text-based RPG with deep branching narrative and card battles. Explore the mystical realm of Aldunia where every choice you make, shapes the story. <i>Will you revive the dragon-god Drakontias or claim his power for yourself?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/6900fe04f0a1897b48be437301c2a0c2.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Aldunia reacts to your actions, ensuring no two playthroughs are the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/afc98a90d4a966d69869e7d00990bc50.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/afc98a90d4a966d69869e7d00990bc50.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/afc98a90d4a966d69869e7d00990bc50.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a deep branching narrative, your choices have far-reaching consequences and can lead to different paths, alliances, and endings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/2f78a78ded79b9cf718ef8a3d0712883.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/2f78a78ded79b9cf718ef8a3d0712883.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/2f78a78ded79b9cf718ef8a3d0712883.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/815f6ad38d574a85fb8b2021d36c84a8.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical card battles that require strategy and foresight. Mastering your deck is key to surviving the dangers that lie ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/532212ab56492758f1b8c73d875391ca.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/532212ab56492758f1b8c73d875391ca.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/532212ab56492758f1b8c73d875391ca.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful hand-painted cards, pace your Stamina, and build your deck to suit your playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/15b287798e081ed1bead2922a6368424.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/15b287798e081ed1bead2922a6368424.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/15b287798e081ed1bead2922a6368424.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/638f0b5d72c5238c8b6d0e7feade6b9f.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last Keeper, your mission is to gather the shattered essence of the dragon-god Drakontias, whose power once maintained the balance of the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/f87e6ba6994b6e21c2e404d1e080c934.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/f87e6ba6994b6e21c2e404d1e080c934.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/f87e6ba6994b6e21c2e404d1e080c934.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse landscapes, from ancient forests to frozen lakes, scorching deserts and desolate ruins, each brought to life with stunning hand-painted illustrations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/56b23335f3c123a94e75691cc1aeca81.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/56b23335f3c123a94e75691cc1aeca81.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/56b23335f3c123a94e75691cc1aeca81.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a wide range of characters and bizarre creatures, each with their own stories, and decide their fate with your choices. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/a11ccb12255b27e94b76d7d0ab81d9db.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/a11ccb12255b27e94b76d7d0ab81d9db.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/a11ccb12255b27e94b76d7d0ab81d9db.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you restore Drakontias to his former glory, or seize his power for your own ambitions? The fate of Aldunia is in your hands.</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/cc0e678a87ff980483cbd2c5fa110864.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/11d0865adf7467ff59710f39e1aa219e.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/11d0865adf7467ff59710f39e1aa219e.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/11d0865adf7467ff59710f39e1aa219e.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a 2-people indie studio from Vancouver \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\udde6 with a passion for storytelling and beautiful art. <strong>Drakontias</strong> is our first indie game, born from a deep passion and nostalgia for the 90's pen-and-paper gamebooks \u2014 <i>Fighting Fantasy</i>, <i>Sorcery!</i>, <i>Lone Wolf</i>, <i>Metamorphose</i> \u2014 and inspired by titles like \u2014 <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Slay the Spire</i>, <i>Roadwarden</i>, <i>80 Days</i>. Our goal is to blend compelling writing, branching narratives, stunning landscapes, rich RPG mechanics, and thrilling card battles into an experience that players will love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your support!</strong> \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2013 Leo Sanders, Founder of Spark Machine</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/a89f7dcb8e928e3520bb38d93bf5014b.avif?t=1738532384\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>IF YOU LIKE THE GAME, PLEASE WISHLIST</strong> \ud83d\udd25<br>You'll get notified when we launch the demo and it helps us reach more players! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drakontias</strong> is an illustrated text-based RPG with deep branching narrative and card battles. Explore the mystical realm of Aldunia where every choice you make, shapes the story. <i>Will you revive the dragon-god Drakontias or claim his power for yourself?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/6900fe04f0a1897b48be437301c2a0c2.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Aldunia reacts to your actions, ensuring no two playthroughs are the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/afc98a90d4a966d69869e7d00990bc50.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/afc98a90d4a966d69869e7d00990bc50.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/afc98a90d4a966d69869e7d00990bc50.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a deep branching narrative, your choices have far-reaching consequences and can lead to different paths, alliances, and endings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/2f78a78ded79b9cf718ef8a3d0712883.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/2f78a78ded79b9cf718ef8a3d0712883.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/2f78a78ded79b9cf718ef8a3d0712883.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/815f6ad38d574a85fb8b2021d36c84a8.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical card battles that require strategy and foresight. Mastering your deck is key to surviving the dangers that lie ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/532212ab56492758f1b8c73d875391ca.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/532212ab56492758f1b8c73d875391ca.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/532212ab56492758f1b8c73d875391ca.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful hand-painted cards, pace your Stamina, and build your deck to suit your playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/15b287798e081ed1bead2922a6368424.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/15b287798e081ed1bead2922a6368424.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/15b287798e081ed1bead2922a6368424.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/638f0b5d72c5238c8b6d0e7feade6b9f.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last Keeper, your mission is to gather the shattered essence of the dragon-god Drakontias, whose power once maintained the balance of the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/f87e6ba6994b6e21c2e404d1e080c934.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/f87e6ba6994b6e21c2e404d1e080c934.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/f87e6ba6994b6e21c2e404d1e080c934.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse landscapes, from ancient forests to frozen lakes, scorching deserts and desolate ruins, each brought to life with stunning hand-painted illustrations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/56b23335f3c123a94e75691cc1aeca81.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/56b23335f3c123a94e75691cc1aeca81.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/56b23335f3c123a94e75691cc1aeca81.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a wide range of characters and bizarre creatures, each with their own stories, and decide their fate with your choices. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/a11ccb12255b27e94b76d7d0ab81d9db.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/a11ccb12255b27e94b76d7d0ab81d9db.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/a11ccb12255b27e94b76d7d0ab81d9db.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you restore Drakontias to his former glory, or seize his power for your own ambitions? The fate of Aldunia is in your hands.</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/cc0e678a87ff980483cbd2c5fa110864.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/11d0865adf7467ff59710f39e1aa219e.poster.avif?t=1738532384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/11d0865adf7467ff59710f39e1aa219e.webm?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/11d0865adf7467ff59710f39e1aa219e.mp4?t=1738532384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a 2-people indie studio from Vancouver \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\udde6 with a passion for storytelling and beautiful art. <strong>Drakontias</strong> is our first indie game, born from a deep passion and nostalgia for the 90's pen-and-paper gamebooks \u2014 <i>Fighting Fantasy</i>, <i>Sorcery!</i>, <i>Lone Wolf</i>, <i>Metamorphose</i> \u2014 and inspired by titles like \u2014 <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Slay the Spire</i>, <i>Roadwarden</i>, <i>80 Days</i>. Our goal is to blend compelling writing, branching narratives, stunning landscapes, rich RPG mechanics, and thrilling card battles into an experience that players will love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your support!</strong> \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2013 Leo Sanders, Founder of Spark Machine</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/c5460dd87fcf18dec955ff06df3b2ebd.webp?t=1738532384\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489720/extras/a89f7dcb8e928e3520bb38d93bf5014b.avif?t=1738532384\" /></span></p>",
